1
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,300
Why are you up so early today?

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,100
I couldn't sleep,
so I figured I'd make some coffee.

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,900
Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot,
enough for both of us to drink all morning.

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,100
- Sure.
- Sugar?

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,600
The shop downstairs has phone cases at 20% off,
so I grabbed one yesterday.

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,100
It came to 128.50 in total,
about 30 cheaper than online.

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200
There's something I've been meaning to tell you.

8
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,100
I might move closer to work next month.

9
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,100
Really?

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,100
Yeah. Two hours of commuting every day
is just too much.

11
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,600
♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪
